{
  "transcriptVersion": 1,
  "id": "exchange-disabled",
  "description": "A product whose Identity service is off (WIRE-CONTRACT-V5 §12.11, WIRE-CONTRACT-V4 §12.8). The client still believes Identity is on (a discovery from before the toggle moved), so exchange() posts the keys to the nonce route and the Worker answers not_found: the route does not exist for this product. The SDK reports the rung unavailable, holds no token and sends no grant.",
  "features": ["identity.exchange"],
  "requires": ["core.store"],
  "product": "djdl",
  "baseUrl": "https://key.plrs.im",
  "now": 1700000000,
  "trust": {
